                                                "sense_id": "72daab89-ad97-3a32-a354-fda86890b6ef",
                                                "text": "The eight files (from left to right for White and from right to left for Black) are indicated by the small letters, a, b, c, d, e, f, g and h, respectively."
                                            }
                                        ]
